📝 USER STORY:
As a Seller
I want to quote and reply to a specific inquiry message with text and an image attachment
So that the buyer has clear context on which message I am answering and can see proof of condition

📋 BUSINESS RULES & PAYLOAD SPECIFICATIONS:
• Endpoint: POST /api/v1/messages/:chatId
• Authentication: Bearer JWT Token required (sender must be chat participant)
• Payload:
  - text (string, optional): Reply content
  - attachments (string[], optional): Photo URLs
  - replyTo (string, optional): Target referenced message ID within the same chat
• Population: replyTo with { text, attachments, sender: { name, profilePicture } }
• Response: { success: true, message: 'Message sent successfully', data: IMessage }

